__pycache__/
*.pyc

# macOS Finder metadata, written into any directory the maintainer opens.
.DS_Store

# The maintainer's own machine nicknames and account names: local policy, never shipped.
.agentcrew-local-identifiers
# This machine's overlay on agentcrew.toml, merged over it key by key (ADR-0029): what is
# true of one machine, never of the project.
agentcrew.local.toml
# Added by code-review-graph
.code-review-graph/
# A crew run's own working directory — spec, tickets, decisions and rendered first turns for the
# feature being built. Scaffolding for building this plugin, never part of it.
features/
# A staged crew run directory, written by the route skill's staging script: a snapshot of tracker
# tickets for one run, refreshed by re-staging. Scaffolding, never part of the plugin.
crewtask/
# The maintainer's own measurements of the merge and review lanes: working notes taken against
# runs on one machine, kept local rather than shipped as documentation of the plugin.
docs/merge-and-review-research.md
# The maintainer's own measurement of Claude Code's process memory: readings taken from one
# machine, named hosts and all, kept local rather than shipped as documentation of the plugin.
docs/claude-code-process-memory-research.md
